{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_051CF0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"以前你把Mammal Pod称作“蝴蝶”吧。不是蛹（pupa），也不是茧（cocoon），而是“成虫”（imago）。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":127,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯。因为Mammal Pod之前的AI都还只是未完成品。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"未完成？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"虽然足以控制机体，却无法做出核报复这种高度判断。距离完成还差一步，所以是蛹。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"输入The Boss的数据之后，AI才第一次获得真正的形态，化作蝴蝶展翅飞翔。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":97,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"所以Peace Walker的机头涂装才画了蝴蝶……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"我给Mammal的AI取了“BS-imago”这个代号。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":52,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"“BS”就是Boss的缩写。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""}]}